Description: Resolve passwd entry for initgroups during privilege drop
 initgroups() was called with the raw nrpe_user string: a numeric
 user ID (e.g. nrpe_user=1000) failed the lookup, and an unset
 nrpe_group passed (gid_t)-1 as the base group - both now fatal under
 the fail-closed privilege drop. The passwd entry is now resolved via
 getpwuid() for numeric users, the user's primary gid is used when no
 group is configured, and when no passwd entry exists at all the
 supplementary group list is cleared explicitly instead of inheriting
 root's groups.
Origin: vendor
Forwarded: not-needed
---
--- a/src/nrpe.c	2026-10-03 01:14:43.143427534 +0200
+++ b/src/nrpe.c	2026-10-03 01:25:00.428399019 +0200
@@ -2475,8 +2489,28 @@
